## Interface: 11509, 16001
## Title: Chat Scan
## Notes: Scan chat channels for keyword groups (OR across rows, AND within a row). Open with /cs or the minimap button.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 1.3.0
## IconTexture: 134442
## SavedVariables: ChatScanDB

# One toc for both clients. A second, flavour-suffixed toc would duplicate this file list for nothing:
# no code branches on which toc loaded, every client difference is detected at runtime in Core\Compat.lua,
# and a duplicated list only invites the two copies to drift apart.
# Load order is the dependency order: Core exports ns.* before UI and Bootstrap read it.

Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

Core\Init.lua
Core\Compat.lua
Core\Store.lua
Core\Scanner.lua
Core\Commands.lua

UI\Panel.lua
UI\MinimapButton.lua

Bootstrap.lua
